WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.527
Your experience is your advantage.

00:00:02.527 --> 00:00:05.151
Put it to work on your next opportunity.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.201
But strong bids take more than expertise.

00:00:10.201 --> 00:00:11.954
They take the right evidence,

00:00:11.954 --> 00:00:14.532
connected at the right moment.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:19.852
BidStream connects tender discovery with your company's capabilities.

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:22.801
Inspect the source, understand the match,

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:26.400
and shortlist the opportunities worth pursuing.

00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:31.243
Turn that shortlist into a tailored expression of interest.

00:00:31.243 --> 00:00:33.624
Review the requirements and evidence,

00:00:33.624 --> 00:00:36.317
then approve your email to the buyer.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.365
Bring the tender documents together.

00:00:39.365 --> 00:00:43.057
Extract the prerequisites, evaluation criteria,

00:00:43.057 --> 00:00:46.540
and response structure, so preparation follows what the

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.851
buyer actually asks for.

00:00:49.913 --> 00:00:52.096
Coordinate technical, staffing,

00:00:52.096 --> 00:00:56.380
legal, and financial contributions with your connected assistant.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:01:00.780
Keep every section grounded in your company's evidence.

00:01:01.813 --> 00:01:03.984
Organise the package in Google Drive.

00:01:03.984 --> 00:01:07.711
Keep the technical response and financial offer clear,

00:01:07.711 --> 00:01:10.822
structured, and ready for your team.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.759
Review the assessment against the buyer's criteria.

00:01:14.759 --> 00:01:17.697
Follow the reasoning, close evidence gaps,

00:01:17.697 --> 00:01:21.214
and turn improvement flags into focused action.

00:01:22.247 --> 00:01:24.023
Your team makes the decisions.

00:01:24.023 --> 00:01:27.146
Confirm qualifications, commercial terms,

00:01:27.146 --> 00:01:31.535
and required signatures. Hand over an organised response

00:01:31.535 --> 00:01:33.578
for final approval.

00:01:34.613 --> 00:01:38.479
BidStream. Turn the experience you've earned into the opportunity

00:01:38.479 --> 00:01:41.486
you pursue next. Start the conversation.
